  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Just Community of Women and Men</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the WCC, creating a Just Community of Women and Men is a transversal priority, cutting across all programme areas. In response to the patriarchy evident in many church structures, the WCC works to ensure that the experiences and participation of both women and men contribute to the transforming renewal of church and society as communities of women and men. The gender perspective will also be brought to the Pilgrimage of Justice and Peace from this transversal priority.</narrative>
  </description>
